          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: kündigen",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "kündigen — \"to quit, to give notice; to cancel\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Sie kündigte nach zehn Jahren bei der Firma. She quit after ten years at the company."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Jemandem kündigen — to dismiss someone. Also to cancel a Vertrag."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "kündigen is built on kund \"known\", an inherited word with the Gothic cousin kunþs \"known\" (EtymDB): to make something known."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
